Decomposition
I used Decomposition throughout the project because the revision platform is made up of multiple independent components, including user authentication, past paper selection, question timing, performance analysis and progress tracking. By breaking the problem into smaller modules, each section can be developed and tested independently before being integrated into the final system. This reduces complexity and makes maintenance easier as new features can be added without affecting the entire system.

